T:How to make 
T:a cool 
T:shelter
T:
T:1.
T:Find a flat
T:area with 
T:slightly 
T:elevated 
T:ground
T:2.
T:Look around
T:and make
T:sure you are 
T:not under a 
T:dead tree or 
T:something
T:that could 
T:fall on you
T:3.
T:Find a long
T:pole and
T:lean it onto
T:a tree/wall
T:4. 
T:Add more 
T:and more
T:long poles 
T:until it 
T:looks like
T:a slope
T:5. 
T:Secure both 
T:sides by 
T:placing big 
T:rocks on the
T:sides
T:6.
T:Add a tarp 
T:or a bunch
T:of sticks
T:and leaves
T:to insulate
T:heat
T:7.
T:If there is 
T:more than 1
T:person,
T:repeat this 
T:and improve 
T:the design
T:based on
T:your 
T:surroundings
T:
T:
T:Provided by
T:Eri & Co